    "title": "JoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run release schedule: when is episode 2 releasing on Netflix?",
    "text": "When you buy through links on our articles, Future and its syndication partners may earn a commission.Credit: Lucky Land Communications/Shueisha, JoJo's Animation SBR ProjectJoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run out on Netflix, but where is episode 2? It's a good question, especially as the streamer hasn't provided the information and the anime series has had a patchy history of release drops on the streamer.We won't be horsing around here: below, you'll find our speculation on the JoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run episode 2 release date and streaming time in the US and UK, plus some more talk about episode counts and schedules. Let's hope it avoids the controversy of Stone Ocean...While you wait, be sure to check out the new anime also debuting in the spring season, plus a look at how to watch JoJo's Bizarre Adventure in order from start to finish.JoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run release date: what time is episode 2 streaming on Netflix?Credit: Lucky Land Communications/Shueisha, JoJo's Animation SBR ProjectIf following a traditional weekly schedule, JoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run episode 2 should be out on March 26 at midnight Pacific/3:00 AM Eastern.We don't believe that will be the case, however.Instead, we anticipate JoJo's won't release a new episode just yet - and will deliver more concrete information about its release plans during its AnimeJapan panel on March 28. Stay tuned, and we'll update this page as soon as we hear more.Jojo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run release schedule: when are new episodes out?Credit: Lucky Land Communications/Shueisha, JoJo's Animation SBR ProjectAs of right now, only one episode of JoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run has been confirmed: the premiere, a bumper-length entry entitled '1st STAGE'.In the past, Netflix has drawn fans' ire by dropping the entire first cour for Stone Ocean and then leaving fans empty-handed for another eight months. It appears the streamer may have learned its lesson, but we're still none the wiser on when new episodes will be released.For now, here's the current confirmed JoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run release scheduleJoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run episode 1: March 19, 2026JoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run episode 2: TBAWhere to watch JoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run and episode count speculationCredit: Lucky Land Communications/Shueisha, JoJo's Animation SBR ProjectJoJo's Bizarre Adventure Steel Ball Run, which follows a unique cross-country horseback race in 19th Century America, will be streaming exclusively on Netflix.While no episode count has been confirmed, we can expect more news at this month's AnimeJapan. We anticipate, however, that it will likely last for around 38-40 episodes, in line with previous seasons. Only one episode has aired so far.Need something new to watch? Here are our picks for the best anime movies and best anime on Netflix.",
